### Local profile secrets ###
# NOTE: do not reintroduce a blanket `**/*.yml` rule here. It silently swallowed
# every newly created config file (git add reported nothing); the tracked
# application-*.yml files only survived because they predated the rule.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
secrets/
*secret*.yml
*secret*.yaml
!application-secret.example.yml

